slug: embeddings-honor-model
owner: claude (opus 5)
started: 2026-09-04
scope:
  - /v1/embeddings honours the `model` field instead of silently serving one embedder
  - the response says which model actually answered, plus usage
  - an unknown or unsupported model is an explicit error, not a substitution
  - several embedders can be resident, bounded, keyed by spec
